  "notable_quotes": [
    "The framework consists of open-ended hollow nanotubes built from hexanuclear Zn6F6(AmTAZ)6 rings, forming a 3D honeycomb network.",
    "Under inert N2, the same MOF transforms instead to zinc cyanamide (ZnCN2), showing atmosphere-dependent solid-state conversion.",
    "The retained crystal shape during conversion suggests the MOF can serve as a precursor route to 1D crystalline nanomaterials."
